### ========================================
### ZONE MANAGEMENT TESTS (Admin Only)
### ========================================

### 1. Get all zones
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. Get zone by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zones/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 3. Create new zone
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nom": "Bureau Principal"
}

### 4. Create another zone
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nom": "Salle de Réunion A"
}

### 5. Create zone - Meeting Room
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nom": "Salle de Conférence"
}

### 6. Update zone
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/zones/1
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nom": "Bureau Principal - Étage 1"
}

### 7. Delete zone
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/zones/3
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8. Test unauthorized access (no token)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zones

### 9. Test unauthorized access (user token instead of admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer invalid_user_token

### 10. Test get non-existent zone
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/zones/999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 11. Test update non-existent zone
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/zones/999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Nom": "Zone Inexistante"
}

### 12. Test delete non-existent zone
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/zones/999
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 13. Test create zone with invalid data
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Name": ""
}

### 14. Test create zone with missing name
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/zones
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}